TuxFrw-NFT Installation
========================

To install TuxFrw-NFT, follow these steps:

1) Run (as root):

# ./install.sh

The configuration and modules will be installed under /etc/tuxfrw-nft.
The installer will copy the main script 'tuxfrw-nft' with executable permissions under /usr/sbin
and deploy the systemd service 'tuxfrw-nft.service' (not enabled at boot by default).

2) Configure your variables in /etc/tuxfrw-nft/tuxfrw.conf and review rule modules under /etc/tuxfrw-nft/rules/

3) Start and test TuxFrw-NFT:
# tuxfrw-nft start (or systemctl start tuxfrw-nft)

4) After testing and verifying your rules, enable it at boot:
# systemctl enable tuxfrw-nft

Read the README and "TuxFrw Manual" for more information on running TuxFrw-NFT.
